    Guidance[AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTEXT.md]
  end
  AppFiles --> App[Generated app]
  Quality --> App
  Security --> App
  Workflow --> App
  Guidance --> App
  Migrate --> Existing[Existing npm or pnpm app]
